3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,143,11)\">Ps 143:11</ref> <bdbheb>אַליָֿבאֹוּ בְּצִדְקָתֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:28\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,28)\">Ps 69:28</ref> (of wicked); as accusative after verbs of declaring, etc., his <highlight>saving</highlight> (<highlight>delivering</highlight>) <highlight>righteousness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:32\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,32)\">Ps 22:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 40:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,11)\">Ps 40:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,16)\">Ps 51:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,15)\">Ps 71:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,16)\">Ps 71:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,24)\">Ps 71:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 98:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"98\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"98\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,98,2)\">Ps 98:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 145:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"145\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"145\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,145,7)\">Ps 145:7</ref> also <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִוָּדַע צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 88:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"88\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"88\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,88,13)\">Ps 88:13</ref> <bdbheb>עֹמֶדֶת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לָעַד</bdbheb> <highlight>his righteousness endureth</highlight> for ever <ref ref=\"Ps 111:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"111\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"111\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,111,3)\">Ps 111:3</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ps 119:142\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"142\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"142\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,142)\">Ps 119:142</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of people, = <highlight>prosperity</highlight>, || <bdbheb>הון</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עשׁר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,18)\">Prov 8:18</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוֺרֶה לצ</bdbheb> <highlight>early rain for prosperity</highlight> <ref ref=\"Joel 2:23\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,23)\">Joel 2:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> plural <highlight>righteous acts:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of God <ref ref=\"Judg 5:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,11)\">Judg 5:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,7)\">1Sam 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 6:5\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,5)\">Mic 6:5</ref> vindication of right <ref ref=\"Ps 103:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"103\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"103\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,103,6)\">Ps 103:6</ref> redemptive <ref ref=\"Isa 45:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,24)\">Isa 45:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,16)\">Dan 9:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of man's moral conduct <ref ref=\"Isa 64:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,64,5)\">Isa 64:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,10)\">Jer 51:10</ref>, also probably <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,20)\">Ezek 3:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,24)\">Ezek 18:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" oncli